<title>UK: UK PSBR 3.41 bln stg in September.</title>
<headline>UK PSBR 3.41 bln stg in September.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK public sector borrowing requirement data for September. Deficits unless noted (rep).</p>
<p> PSBR (in bln stg)		  SEPT    APR-SEPT   APR-SEPT</p>
<p>						    1996/97    1995/96</p>
<p> Public sector			3.41    16.136     20.050</p>
<p> Central government		 3.614   16.616     21.441</p>
<p> Central government own acct    3.775   17.214     20.773</p>
<p> Local Authority			434REP   299	  286</p>
<p>  from central govt		    90REP   777	  517</p>
<p> General Government		 3.270   16.138     21.210</p>
<p> Public Corporation		    69    1.377REP  1.009REP</p>
<p>  from central govt		    71REP 1.375REP     151</p>
<p>GOVERNMENT RECEIPTS</p>
<p> Central govt total receipts   20.286  120.775    114.267</p>
<p> Inland Revenue receipts	  6.737   43.187     42.045</p>
<p> Customs and excise		 5.947   39.852     37.176</p>
<p> Social security		    3.448   22.104     21.048</p>
<p> Interest			     1.310    3.917	3.723</p>
<p> Other				  2.844   11.715	10.275</p>
<p>CENTRAL GOVERNMENT OUTLAYS</p>
<p>  Total				24.061  137.989     135.040</p>
<p>   of which Interest		3.380   13.507	11.090</p>
<p>   Net departmental outlays    21.678  128.159     123.950</p>
<p>NOTE- Privatisation costs/proceeds in September were 997 million stg.</p>
<p>Forecast was for a 2.7 bln stg Sept PSBR.</p>
